added:        2026-11-12 by @vansyson1308
notes:        Crop (2400x706 px at 2x) of the top of the Effects workspace on the Earth Views - Look sequence: Effect Controls of the selected clip (Motion, Opacity), the Program monitor on NASA's Earth Views from the ISS with the Golden Dusk Color Grading look, and the Effects browser open on Video Transitions > Dissolve. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1). Contains no Adobe artwork. Rebuild and recapture with the scripts in docs/images/scripts/ (README there): build_trailer.py, then capture_gallery.py effects.
Media visible or used in the screenshot (none of it is committed to the repository):
  - Earth Views from the ISS (NASA, NHQ_2020_1221, no-music edition). US Government work, public domain; NASA does not endorse this project. Source: https://images.nasa.gov/details/NHQ_2020_1221_Earth%20Views
